      "final_text": "美国市场：上周美国股票下跌（标普500指数 -1.6%，纳斯达克指数 -2.9%），半导体（SOX -10%）、内存（DRAM -16%）及大型科技股表现疲软。国债收益率曲线呈陡峭化走势，短端下行而长端维持高位（2年期 -3个基点至4.18%，10年期 -1个基点至4.55%，30年期 +1个基点至5.07%）。黄金下跌 -2.3%，至近$4,000美元/盎司。布伦特原油因中东局势再度升温而大涨 +17%，至约$88美元。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. equities fell last week (S&P 500 -1.6%, Nasdaq -2.9%) with weakness in semiconductors (SOX -10%), memory (DRAM -16%) and big tech. Treasury yields fell on the short end while the long-end remained elevated in a steepening move (2Y -3bps to 4.18%, 10Y -1bps to 4.55%, 30Y +1bps to 5.07%). Gold fell -2.3% to nearly $4,000/oz. Brent crude surged +17% to ~$88 as Middle East tensions ramped up again.",
